# Paths that execute with the repository's own credentials.
#
# A change under any of these runs during CI rather than merely being tested by
# it: workflows and Dockerfiles execute directly, and tests/ is what flow.sh
# runs. Requiring an owner's review is the enforced version of "read the diff
# before you queue it".
#
# Fork pull requests are refused outright for /build/ and /.github/ in
# rust-pr.yml's check-files, so this covers same-repo changes.

/build/          @FalkorDB/maintainers
/.github/        @FalkorDB/maintainers
/tests/          @FalkorDB/maintainers
